# direnv: enters the flake's default shell (docs/development.md, "The Nix shells"). Run `direnv allow` once after reading this file.
# Besides flake.nix and flake.lock the flake reads these, so a change to one reloads the shell
watch_file dm/nix/shell_hook.sh dm/host/rust/rust-toolchain.toml .github/requirements/tools.txt
use flake
# This checkout's own additions, not committed
source_env_if_exists .envrc.local
